een-two-plates-of-a-capacitor-is-math-jee-main-physics-motion-jqtxn9lzozoqripz","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2023 (Online) 10th April Evening Shift","year":2023,"subject":"physics","chapter":"capacitor","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"content":"<p>The distance between two plates of a capacitor is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.258ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 556 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"64\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-64\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and its capacitance is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.621ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 1158.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, when air is the medium between the plates. If a metal sheet of thickness <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.816ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.632ex\" height=\"2.817ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -884.7 1163.4 1245.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(404.9,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><rect width=\"923.4\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and of the same area as plate is introduced between the plates, the capacitance of the capacitor becomes <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.621ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 1158.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. The ratio <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.021ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.849ex\" height=\"3.158ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -944.6 1259.2 1395.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,446.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g><rect width=\"1019.2\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"1 : 1"},{"identifier":"B","content":"3 : 1"},{"identifier":"C","content":"2 : 1"},{"identifier":"D","content":"4 : 1"}],"correct_options":["B"],"explanation":"<p>When a metal sheet of thickness (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.816ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.632ex\" height=\"2.817ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -884.7 1163.4 1245.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(404.9,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><rect width=\"923.4\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) is introduced between the plates of a capacitor, it divides the capacitor into two separate capacitors. The metal sheet acts as a new plate in each capacitor, and because the metal is a conductor, it is at the same potential as the plates on either side. </p>\n<p>The capacitance of the original capacitor with air between the plates is given by:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.181ex\" height=\"2.978ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -963.4 4058.2 1316.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1436.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2492.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,457.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(842.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"41\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-41\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(586.5,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"64\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-64\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1326.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>where (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.906ex\" height=\"1.35ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -431 842.6 596.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) is the permittivity of free space, (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.697ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 750 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"41\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-41\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) is the area of one of the plates, and (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.258ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 556 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"64\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-64\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) is the distance between the plates.</p>\n<p>When the metal sheet of thickness (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.816ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.632ex\" height=\"2.817ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -884.7 1163.4 1245.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(404.9,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><rect width=\"923.4\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) is introduced, the distance between the plates is reduced by (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.816ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.632ex\" height=\"2.817ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -884.7 1163.4 1245.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(404.9,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><rect width=\"923.4\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>), so the capacitance of each of the new capacitors is:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.63ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.269ex\" height=\"3.81ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -963.4 4538.9 1683.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(755,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2032\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-2032\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1277.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2333,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(539.9,457.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(842.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"41\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-41\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-465.6) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"64\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-64\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1334,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(404.9,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><rect width=\"923.4\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><rect width=\"1965.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Simplifying, we get:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.621ex\" height=\"2.978ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -963.4 4252.7 1316.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(755,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2032\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-2032\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1277.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2333,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,457.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1342.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"41\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-41\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(763.3,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"64\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-64\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1679.7\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Since the two capacitors are in parallel with each other, the total capacitance is:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"27.057ex\" height=\"2.978ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -963.4 11959.3 1316.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1436.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2492.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(2992.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(755,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2032\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-2032\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4269.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5325.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6047.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(7047.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,457.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D716\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D716\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(439,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1342.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"41\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-41\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(763.3,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"64\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-64\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1679.7\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(9245,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(10300.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(10800.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>So the ratio of the capacitances is:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.021ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.014ex\" height=\"3.158ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -944.6 4426.3 1395.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,446.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1019.2\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1537,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2592.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3370.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3926.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n","exam":"jee-main"}]}